OL,3,GNEWSAPatient safety should be first -
OL,4,Asurgeons speak out on emergency general
OL,5,Asurgery
OL,6,
OL,7,FDamian McKay, an Ulster Hospital
OL,8,Fsurgeon, said he and others were
OL,9,F"concerned, disappointed and
OL,10,Ffrustrated".
OL,12,FThe new Health Minister Robbie Butler
OL,13,Fhas said his decisions will be based on
OL,14,F"expert evidence opinion" as well as
OL,15,Fthe "voices of the people".
